// 'Zero-Day' — Beeple (Mike Winkelmann), frame 180 of the film
// (beeple-crap.com; distributed with pbrt-v4-scenes — use per that
// repo's README). A dark voting-machine hall lit by 283 area lights —
// warm 2300 K bulb strips, 6000 K panel floods in louvered fixture
// boxes, two rgb screens — this corpus's many-light stress scene.
// Sparse clone pinned at 30cf4a0;
// `scenes/corpus/fetch.sh zero-day` materializes the source; this RON
// was bootstrapped once by `cenote-cli import
// sources/pbrt-v4-scenes/zero-day/frame180.pbrt` and is the source of
// truth — re-imports diff into scratch, never over it. Native oracle:
// pbrt volpath (its default), maxdepth 5, halton; compared at 256 spp
// (1024 renders indistinguishable at eighth-res — converged).
//
// This scene earned its rung: nearly everything in it is authored
// through mirrored transform chains, which exposed the renderer's
// wrong-side emission under negative-determinant instances — fixed at
// this rung ("An emitter keeps its face through every mirror";
// docs/corpus-plan.md rung-4 notes tell the story). The eyeball the
// recon scheduled is resolved: all 283 emissive meshes wind with
// their authored normals.
//
// Import fidelity: eighth-res RMSE 0.035 against pbrt with its film
// simulation stripped — and the film IS the headline knowing gap. The
// scene's Film block carries a Canon EOS 100D sensor response, 5500 K
// white balance, and ISO 175, all dropped at import (cenote renders
// scene-referred radiance; no unlock scheduled): the sensor and white
// balance neutralize the bulbs' 2300 K warmth and the ISO scales
// exposure, so native-vs-native measures 0.495 on tone alone. Beyond
// the film: the RustMixed metals' roughness rides a ×0.01 "scale"
// texture the importer cannot fold — 30 materials read raw texels
// (~0.2–0.8) instead of near-mirror (importer debt), and their coat
// roughness textures import smooth (material-depth work); the BASE
// ROOM's bump displacement is dropped (374 shapes, the class bathroom
// priced). All remaining warnings are those four families.
